VW_Flash — Simos18 checksum and CRC
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Project:  VW_Flash — https://github.com/bri3d/VW_Flash
Author:   Brian Ledbetter and contributors
Licence:  BSD 2-Clause "Simplified" License

Used in:  simoscal/checksum.py

The Simos18 CAL checksum implementation in simoscal/checksum.py — the CRC32
parameters and lookup-table construction, the checksum header layout, and the
ECM3 monitor summation — is adapted from VW_Flash's lib/checksum.py and
lib/fastcrc.py. The CRC lookup table is generated at import time rather than
vendored, and reproduces VW_Flash's table byte-for-byte.

